sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Clients
  participant G as Gateway
  participant S1 as session1 (owner, fence 1)
  participant R as Redis
  participant S2 as session2
  participant PG as Postgres
  S1-xS1: killed (SIGKILL)
  C->>G: OP
  G->>S1: forward
  G-->>C: UNAVAILABLE (link down),<br/>client keeps the op queued
  Note over R: lease expires within 15 s
  G->>R: board:owner:id exists? (1 s<br/>watchdog) no
  G->>S2: ENSURE (preferred by<br/>rendezvous hash)
  S2->>R: fence 2, lease NX
  S2->>PG: UPDATE boards SET fence = 2,<br/>load snapshot + tail
  S2->>R: announce owner
  C->>G: resend queue in order
  G->>S2: forward
  S2-->>C: OP_ACK (duplicates get their<br/>original ACK)
